        en: "Farmer Jan lives in a polder, more than four metres below sea level. When Sam visits him, he points at the long green bank behind the farm. 'Do you know what lies behind it?' he asks. Sam shakes his head. 'Water,' says Farmer Jan. 'An awful lot of water. Without that dike my kitchen would be an aquarium.' Sam laughs, but now he really wants to know exactly how a dike like that works.",
