        en: "The mayor called the council together. 'We must do something,' he said, 'but what?' They tried cats, traps and poison, but there were only more and more rats. Then there was a knock on the door of the town hall. In stepped a tall, thin man in a coat of red and yellow patches. A wooden pipe hung around his neck. 'I can rid your town of the rats,' he said calmly.",
