        en: "'What do you want for it?' asked the mayor suspiciously. 'A thousand gold coins,' answered the man. The councillors were shocked at that amount, but they were at their wits' end. 'Agreed,' the mayor said quickly, and he shook the man's hand. The stranger smiled, put the pipe to his lips and walked slowly out into the street. He played a strange, cheerful tune that rang through every street.",
