        en: "One autumn afternoon his mother asked him to take a basket of biscuits to an old blind man. He lived on the other side of the dike, quite a long walk away. Hansje thought it was a nice little job. The old man always told exciting stories about the old days, about ships and storms. When it was time to go home, it was already later than Hansje thought. The sun was slowly sinking behind the clouds.",
